# Game_Musical — Musical Chairs (ID 26)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Musical.h, Game_Musical.cpp
# HTML: data/game_musical_setup.html, game_musical_names.html, game_musical_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Musical Chairs (Reise nach Jerusalem). N-1 pucks for N players.
Music plays → pucks show rainbow. Music stops → purple double-chase → press fast!
One player eliminated per round. Last standing wins.

## CONFIG
- initialPlayers, baseTimeSec, pauseTimeSec
- varType: random variance 0=2s, 1=5s, 2=10s

## STATES
MUS_SETUP → MUS_WAITING → MUS_PLAYING (timed) → MUS_OPEN (press now!) → MUS_PAUSED_INTERIM → loop → MUS_FINISHED

## PUCK STATES
0=active, 1=pressed (this round), 2=eliminated, 3=manually disabled

## KEY MECHANICS
- Active pucks = initialPlayers - 1 (one always unavailable)
- Round duration: baseTimeSec*1000 + random(0, varMs)
- MUS_OPEN: purple double-chase signal, all press
- endRound(): if 1 puck left → winner (fanfare), else → PAUSED_INTERIM
- PAUSED_INTERIM: after pauseTimeSec → eliminateRandomPuck() → startRound()
- Elimination: random selection from active+pressed candidates
- Already-pressed puck: red fail + 300ms error sound
- Manual controls: force_open, toggle_pause, toggle_puck

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_ply, cfg_base, cfg_var, cfg_pause, start, stop, reset, exit,
force_open, toggle_pause, toggle_puck

## STATUS JSON
{st, act (active count), t (time remaining), pucks: [{id, s (state)}]}
